@it-glen/dsh-mcp-manager README · Troubleshooting: a historical session will not open after upgrading (#723)：**Symptom**: after upgrading DSH to 0.1.5 or later, a historical session reports in the GUI:

```
历史加载失败：failed to observe session "session-…":
cannot safely transform unclassified message source;
source v0 artifact remains unchanged (raw log: …/session.jsonl.zstd)（gateway/internal）
```

@it-glen/dsh-mcp-manager README · Troubleshooting: a historical session will not open after upgrading (#723)：- Stop `dsh web` first: a session log being written is not guaranteed safe to rewrite
- The repaired artifacts then load through DSH's own migration chain (the original artifacts
  are preserved by design)

